{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "04XE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$f : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$R = U \\times_\\mathcal{X} U$", "MATH_0005": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0006": "$f_{can} : [U/R] \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$|R| \\to |U| \\times |U|$", "MATH_0008": "$|\\mathcal{X}| = |U|/|R|$", "MATH_0009": "$[U/R]$", "MATH_0010": "$f_{can}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-points-presentation}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebraic-lemma-map-space-into-stack}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-points-presentation}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-more-general-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f9fee3c858358e470269eac183f22859e92fb931b70f359e6c28f0ad09405148", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:51872e922d1978adac378dce0a2fba27a6548576c68e0403c55c51359d3ce6c9", "source_text": "The result of\nLemma <REF_0001>\ncan be generalized as follows.\nLet <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space and let <MATH_0003> be a surjective\nmorphism (which makes sense by\nSection <REF_0002>).\nLet <MATH_0004>, let <MATH_0005> be the groupoid\nin algebraic spaces, and let <MATH_0006> be the\ncanonical morphism as constructed in\nAlgebraic Stacks, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nThen the image of <MATH_0007> is an equivalence relation\nand <MATH_0008>. The proof of\nLemma <REF_0004>\nworks without change. (Of course in general <MATH_0009> is not an algebraic\nstack, and in general <MATH_0010> is not an isomorphism.)\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:116e2e6e3ab5db8d2642f2dddcc8790bbfb1f079b951f63f04e1944877293db8", "unit_id": "tag:04XK:statement"}
